A||||1||Cliff Pennock||More bad luck...
Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||03-22-99||07:55 AM||||Well, last week someone hit my Fiero from behind and I had a bit of damage to the paint... But today, somebody hit my car on the front and I have considerable damage (nose, lid and side)! It wasn't my fault and the guy kept on apologising. He saw the damage and he felt so bad about it, I almost felt sorry for *him*!<p>Anyway, his insurance will pay for all the damage but it hurts down to my toes to see my Fiero in the state as it is in now...
Z||000001||Punkndrublic||03-22-99||09:32 PM||||I totally sympathize with you, back in october some guy decided to make a left turn in front of me and ended up grinding a 6 inch wide gash down the driver side (from the wheel to the air scoop). I ended up on the sidewalk a foot away from the lighpost. Needless to say I was not happy especailly when the towtruck guy dragged my car off the sidewalk and I saw what it did to it  :-(
